                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2802: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Uruguay</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Wright</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-20T13:00:00-05:00">January 20, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2. Your 4, January 18, 6 p.m. Please express to Minister of Foreign Affairs the
                    hearty appreciation of this Government for his helpful and cooperative attitude
                    in the matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
